<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Cemex raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Cemex raised.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Credit Suisse First Boston analyst Rafael Elias-Linero said Monday he raised his rating on Mexico's Cemex SA stock to buy from hold.</p>
<p>-- The upgrade is &quot;based on our expectations of a strong second quarter that should show growing volumes and healthier business conditions across almost all of the company's markets,&quot; he wrote in an analysis.</p>
<p>-- &quot;With the first evidence of a recovering formal construction sector in Mexico, and favorable results in Spain and Venezuela, Cemex shall again prove the benefits of its geographical diversification.&quot;</p>
<p>-- The company's B shares were off 0.15 peso to 37.40 pesos early Monday afternoon in Mexico City.</p>
<p>((--Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1879))</p>
</text>
